<rss xmlns:ns0="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>罗翔说刑法 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/517327498</link><ns0:link href="http://rss.materium.io/bilibili/user/video/517327498" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /><description>罗翔说刑法 的 bilibili 空间 - Powered by RSSHub</description><generator>RSSHub</generator><webMaster>contact@rsshub.app (RSSHub)</webMaster><language>en</language><image><url>https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/face/4e5d0a51273fe3f8fabc700b6a71bb8a38c9e21e.jpg</url><title>罗翔说刑法 的 bilibili 空间</title><link>https://space.bilibili.com/517327498</link></image><lastBuildDate>Wed, 08 Apr 2026 02:53:20 GMT</lastBuildDate><ttl>5</ttl><item><title>人文十问，快问快答</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116315834554585&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV12FXoBPEKE" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e4e90a41965fccbcd9f3952161b8ff04789f0c1e.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 收到十个问题，做了一个简单的回答。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12FXoBPEKE</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV12FXoBPEKE</guid><pubDate>Fri, 03 Apr 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>愚人的请教</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116326521772760&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1bx9VBHEsy" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f83a076cc90bafdb2b2d2ee056a9fdceb7f0871e.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 今天愚人节，作为愚蠢渺小的我想请教大家一个法律问题。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bx9VBHEsy</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bx9VBHEsy</guid><pubDate>Wed, 01 Apr 2026 02:10:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】给企业打差评属于损害商业信誉、商品声誉罪吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116275351265104&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1y4QQB7E4J" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/8ec5f1817b92162e37f6c983e145cde588511fc1.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 个人有名誉，企业自然也有商誉。个人的名誉权，与企业的商誉权，哪个更值得保护呢？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1y4QQB7E4J</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1y4QQB7E4J</guid><pubDate>Sat, 28 Mar 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】闹市公然发生不雅行为，算寻衅滋事还是传播淫秽物品？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116275334420544&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1WtQQB2EJx" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/7b46d7023710d979e9aeff0918e1dd1b8e98cab2.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 对公然发生不雅行为的处罚的根据应该是冒犯原则，也即侵犯了不想看不想听的人的自由，但很多时候，现场的吃瓜群众没有感到冒犯，甚至还起哄，所以，发生这种事情，到底应该怎么判断？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WtQQB2EJx</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1WtQQB2EJx</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Mar 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】清末四大疑案之杨乃武与小白菜案</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116255252092910&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1J8w1z7EpH" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/55f8bb5c2e3897ee7387e1f6f1bdd4002b75f47f.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 杨乃武与小白菜案是清末四大疑案之一，案件经过九次审理，最终大白天下。案件的平反昭雪与新闻报道有莫大关系，可算中国历史新闻监督第一案。这个案件错综复杂，既可以窥见人治司法之一斑，也可知晓罪疑惟轻思想很容易导致案件久拖不决。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1J8w1z7EpH</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1J8w1z7EpH</guid><pubDate>Fri, 20 Mar 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】有人钻法律漏洞怎么办？如何合理地给法律“补漏”？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116220237975983&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1iecUz7EtE" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/aa9f239a04a8506ecd549272d4ce906c52a53d63.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 当法律出现漏洞，如果导致了一种普遍性的不公平，那就可以期待将来立法机关的法律修改。但是法律修改之前，司法人员应该如何弥补漏洞呢？如果用道德弥补，那只能接受消极道德主义；其次是通过兜底罪弥补，但必须遵循等价值限缩的方法；再次则是通过类推弥补，但只能允许对行为人有利的类推。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iecUz7EtE</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1iecUz7EtE</guid><pubDate>Sun, 15 Mar 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】爱民官员办怪案，积极道德主义和消极道德主义区别何在？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116134170861399&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1CLfeBjEAz" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/ed240885a74140a7578fc0a35c82780363697960.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 今天给大家讲两个有意思的案子，一个是西汉时期的黄霸戮乱案，另一个是北宋时期的安崇绪诉继母案。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CLfeBjEAz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1CLfeBjEAz</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Feb 2026 02:55:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】2025年终总结，如何避免幻灭，获得内心自洽？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116069477916085&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1prZJBuESm" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/f48daef6e46eb263414544b9537da4b193c2afde.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 聊聊2025，聊聊最近读的书。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1prZJBuESm</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1prZJBuESm</guid><pubDate>Sun, 15 Feb 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】张三故意服毒“诈”商家，自己进了ICU，“娃娃菜中毒案”的法律分析</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116057884923578&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1pncqztEF7" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/877346132ab5b11cf0035d9ccd0c3098ffe8f434.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; -</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pncqztEF7</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pncqztEF7</guid><pubDate>Fri, 13 Feb 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】反转反转再反转，“后真相时代”我们应该如何自处</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=116032702255477&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1ZsFbzZEfq" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/5380758a07a9fa7f84af95897453580513f324a1.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 有学者感叹，当前的传播规律是后真相时代，人们不关注真相，而更关系情绪的满足，在后真相时代，“共同的客观真理标准已然消失”，不知道大家如何看待这个问题？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZsFbzZEfq</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZsFbzZEfq</guid><pubDate>Sun, 08 Feb 2026 02:45:57 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】张三打麻将出老千，是赌博还是诈骗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115984652376069&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1NQ6zBpE8M" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/e129571f6e3c329fa7003436275878a5bda62d05.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 最近有媒体报道，一女子姑且称之为张三打麻将戴特殊隐形眼镜“出老千”被抓，同桌几人将张三抓住并报警，结果这位女子很委屈：“我虽然戴透视眼镜，但我也输了”。问题于是出现了，张三的行为是违法犯罪吗？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1NQ6zBpE8M</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1NQ6zBpE8M</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Jan 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】诈骗案的被害人也有罪？看守所里自学法律的张三让我叹为观止</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115939270008609&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1eSBZBUErm" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/d48d09379a8d5f3aaf883adb06a299f4017cda85.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 最近，收到很多诈骗国家补贴案件的咨询。这让我想起了20多年前的一个案件，当时我刚刚从事法律事务，但是这个案件让我记忆犹新。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eSBZBUErm</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1eSBZBUErm</guid><pubDate>Fri, 23 Jan 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】被上岸男友分手，他好几个T的硬盘能算他违法吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115917677664378&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1d1ktBCEaJ" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/827f6e7595ad6f8866fe3e9f3e26e11d04756f65.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 张三考编基本上岸了，觉得女朋友李四没有和他一起进步，所以分手了。李四非常非常非常生气，所以准备系统的学习法律，惩罚张三。听朋友说张三已经公示了，所以李四拿出了“法律武器”。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1d1ktBCEaJ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1d1ktBCEaJ</guid><pubDate>Mon, 19 Jan 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】文帝废肉刑与方向性的善好</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115865601185228&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1vArMBmEgy" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c8a3cb5a57bf14ae0b8bd5b2b5c12053fa15c1cb.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 最近全国刑法学会的一个重要主题是对重刑主义的反思，对慎刑思想的提倡。这让我想到中国历史上一个有关慎刑思想的著名的例子，那就是文帝废除肉刑，今天这期视频我们就来展开讲讲。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vArMBmEgy</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1vArMBmEgy</guid><pubDate>Sat, 10 Jan 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】每年一度自我反思，以及我对5种行为准则的思考</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115788174335348&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1crBzBGEoR" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/cfdc188191da0de8593e877dcbceb5a845744539.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 前几天有朋友抛出一个尖锐的问题：你觉得自己是一个好人吗？ 我不禁反思自己曾经有过的行为准则。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1crBzBGEoR</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1crBzBGEoR</guid><pubDate>Sat, 27 Dec 2025 02:40:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>侮辱、诈骗、网暴，2025年度法条有哪些？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115745862189411&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1tYqZBiEVw" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/4f851b9ff6aff6b41c5242ee42abe7159f07e29b.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 2025年度法条盘点！法律不是抽象的，它关乎每个人的生活，关乎每个人的尊严。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tYqZBiEVw</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1tYqZBiEVw</guid><pubDate>Sat, 20 Dec 2025 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】如果杨过买一只神雕，他犯法吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115735711979371&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1MfqLBUEA4" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/54ca16b514690248754f31ea5b04a08690a2ee1e.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 杨过买神雕犯法吗？这个问题把我问住了，因为这至少涉及三个问题，一是神雕是什么品种？二是，该品种是几级保护动物？三是犯什么法？今天这期视频我们讲讲这个问题。 （参考文献：《先秦法家重刑主义批判》，中外法学2012年第6期）</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MfqLBUEA4</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1MfqLBUEA4</guid><pubDate>Fri, 19 Dec 2025 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】精神病人真的“杀人不犯法”吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115579969085266&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1b4ycBfEE8" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/a9474ce8f825eab73100a18432859f8b745bcdb6.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 我们经常听说，精神病人杀人不负刑事责任。但是，这显然是对法律的误读。法律中说的是精神病人在不能辨认或不能控制自己行为的时候，经法定程序确认的才不负刑事责任。而没有说精神病人一律不负刑事责任。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1b4ycBfEE8</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1b4ycBfEE8</guid><pubDate>Thu, 20 Nov 2025 03:48:22 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】看到路人被车撞打电话报警就要负责到底吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115561967129116&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1uLCaByEJ2" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/579acdb75f5b03b2673bf1f07162219334f30a93.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 这几天有很多朋友发给我一个“触发救助义务”的视频，说是“不救人就没事，救人反而要负责到底”，这是真的吗？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uLCaByEJ2</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uLCaByEJ2</guid><pubDate>Mon, 17 Nov 2025 04:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】张三想“我以为她死了？这是故意杀人吗？”</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115545525456964&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1m5CTBMEjT" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/0bea76a94cb057a921721ff68f21fbfcf3733754.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 张三实施故意杀人，以为妻子已经死亡，所以将妻子从山崖抛下，想要制造妻子自杀的假象，但事实上妻子死于高空坠落。这应该如何定性呢？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1m5CTBMEjT</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1m5CTBMEjT</guid><pubDate>Fri, 14 Nov 2025 04:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】张三损毁电梯犯什么罪？电梯属于电车吗？是公共交通工具吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115489657397031&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Vr1kBsEUv" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i0.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/bf1eea3f7ccd974ce799ad36885071e16d808709.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 损毁电梯危及公共安全犯什么罪？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Vr1kBsEUv</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Vr1kBsEUv</guid><pubDate>Tue, 04 Nov 2025 05:03:03 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】死缓还不够，犯人上诉要求给自己加刑？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115450734188614&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1UdyBBeEaJ" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/afffcffcbc1f4c2f456a33cf9f31f506ea1fb52e.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 这是一个真实的案例，今天我们讲讲上诉不加刑制度。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UdyBBeEaJ</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UdyBBeEaJ</guid><pubDate>Tue, 28 Oct 2025 10:05:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】一碗肥肠炒面救了两个人的命？什么是犯罪预备？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115433588004816&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1JgsRzaEGL" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c354d17579ec415f133e51307a29afdfd65db310.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 张三因情感纠纷，尾随妻子的情人，并购买水果刀企图杀害对方，结果走着走着就饿了，就去吃了碗肥肠炒面，这碗面阻止了张三实施更大错误。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JgsRzaEGL</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JgsRzaEGL</guid><pubDate>Sat, 25 Oct 2025 09:25:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】在家加班生病了，这算工伤吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115380974590775&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1UcWazLEyg" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/c4fb6f1c231ebba77281715dca37d8b69815804a.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 针对这个问题我专门学习了一下劳动法，这期视频咱们聊一下这个问题。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UcWazLEyg</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1UcWazLEyg</guid><pubDate>Thu, 16 Oct 2025 03:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】进入合租者房间偷拍隐私视频，该当何罪？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115347973741872&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Va4EztEak" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/44e87c7964e3977651fc530267feb408fb126482.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 张三和一位女生合租，居然在女生房间偷偷安装了一个小型摄像头，而且还多次进入房间调试拍摄视角，通过手机App偷窥女生的隐私。这种行为属于什么犯罪？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Va4EztEak</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Va4EztEak</guid><pubDate>Fri, 10 Oct 2025 04:32:04 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】炸裂的英国摩根案，性侵犯罪中的法律认识错误</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115264003772994&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1Rin4zNEyU" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/afb68b6b209c567bf5444c46dee54e5b15b260ad.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 摩根是一位皇家海军官员，一晚他与三位同事一起喝酒，酒后摩根邀请三位朋友和自己妻子发生性行为。他告诉三位朋友，如果他的妻子反抗，那是假装的，她的真实想法其实是同意，而且暴力会让她更加兴奋。于是这三位男性不顾摩根妻子的反抗和她发生了性行为。最后这三位男性被控强奸，但他们认为自己当时确实认为女方同意了。这个案件最终是如何判决的？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Rin4zNEyU</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Rin4zNEyU</guid><pubDate>Thu, 25 Sep 2025 08:33:50 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】性侵犯还能是过失犯罪？性侵犯罪中的事实认识错误</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115228603980839&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1ZCWgzTEdr" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2f58e90efa2f6f349738b296ea4a87da41f63bf2.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 性侵犯罪是一种故意犯罪，有同学说，这多新鲜啊，性侵犯罪肯定是故意啊。但其实你去看法条，无论是刑法第236条强奸罪、236条之一的负有照护职责人员性侵罪、237条的强制猥亵、侮辱罪和猥亵儿童罪，所以你凭啥说性侵犯罪就一定是故意犯罪呢？我们今天就来聊聊性侵犯罪中的事实认识错误。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZCWgzTEdr</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ZCWgzTEdr</guid><pubDate>Fri, 19 Sep 2025 04:30:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>【罗翔】龟鳖之分？我们能否对事物精准定义？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115195217254370&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1bWpLzaEpB" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2019a3aec5966d4a3acf85a77ff43efdbd5648b0.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 人类有限性的一个体现就是我们无法对事务做出准确的定义，虽然我们又不得不进行这种定义。很多时候你以为知道这个概念之所指，但仔细一琢磨发现自己其实茫然无知。如果说未经审视的人生不值得一过，那么未经审视的概念也不值得一提。</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bWpLzaEpB</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1bWpLzaEpB</guid><pubDate>Sat, 13 Sep 2025 05:06:55 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>一万只蟑螂和“张三”的过往纠葛？｜法学教师们的“青椒”故事【一麦三连EP11】</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115177081019842&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1ngHSzLEf6" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i1.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/2e7a18a6c37809f6c6f7fd96f35b311d27d8e22b.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 非常高兴和大物，以及并肩二十多年的同事、好友——赵宏、陈碧、李宏勃老师一起聊聊过去的“青椒”岁月。青年教师时期的事仿佛还在眼前。 时值教师节来临之际，也祝我的同事们、以及各位老师们节日快乐！</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ngHSzLEf6</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ngHSzLEf6</guid><pubDate>Wed, 10 Sep 2025 01:00:00 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item><item><title>七夕夜，张三冒充市长的儿子构成招摇撞骗罪吗？</title><description>&lt;iframe width="640" height="360" src="https://www.bilibili.com/blackboard/html5mobileplayer.html?aid=115105274599496&amp;amp;cid=&amp;amp;bvid=BV1pZh1zFE7e" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt; &lt;br&gt; &lt;img src="https://i2.hdslb.com/bfs/archive/90e8bef286ffaa543cd9c48e4acc644ff8bc06c3.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"&gt;&lt;br&gt; 冒充退休市长，算招摇撞骗罪吗？</description><link>https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pZh1zFE7e</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pZh1zFE7e</guid><pubDate>Thu, 28 Aug 2025 07:47:37 GMT</pubDate><author>罗翔说刑法</author></item></channel></rss>